	"Description": "Mediterranean themed wizard buildings — This mod replaces the vanilla wizard buildings [CP &amp; AT].\n<br />\n<br />COMPATIBILITY\n<br />- Should be compatible with different wizard buildings retexture mod as long as you 'turn off' the wizard buildings that you don't want or you set it to 'false'.\n<br />- Compatible with SDV 1.5 &amp; 1.6\n<br />\n<br />INSTALLATION:\n<br />1. Download and extract the mod files.\n<br />2. Move the extracted files to your Mods folder.\n<br />3. Launch the game.\n<br />\n<br />NOTES:\n<br />- Italian Countryside Buildings is updated now!\n<br />- Please let me know if there are any issues.\n<br />- This was originally planned to be in my previous mod, but it has a different theme so I decided to make it a separate mod. You're free to still use it tho :3\n<br />- MISAMO 'IDENTITY' M/V OUT NOW!! GO SUPPORT &amp; STREAM THEIR MUSIC ON STREAMING PLATFORMS!",
